  "body": "## What changed\r\n\r\n- Extracted `PreparedBand`, `prepare_band`, `emit_band`, and `finish_contour` in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/contour.rs` with no duplicate band setup or emission logic.\r\n- Added `crates/motion/src/machining2d/contour_whole.rs` exporting `contour_whole_bodies` and `contour_whole_bodies_with` through `crates/motion/src/machining2d/mod.rs`.\r\n- Wired whole-model solid `OpParams::Contour` (`SrcRef::Entity`, `!contour_open`) in `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs` to call `contour_whole_bodies_with` with `whole_contour_area` and union per-band `contour_reach` for `carry_need!`.\r\n- Updated `crates/app/tests/real_tip_contour.rs` (`boss_top`) so its filleted-boss tests select the boss top face (`SrcRef::Selection`) instead of walking down past the boss foot onto the base plate.\r\n- Added integration pin suites `crates/app/tests/contour_whole_step.rs` and `crates/motion/tests/contour_whole.rs`.\r\n- Recorded architectural decisions in `docs/decisions/2436-whole-model-contour-steps.md`.\r\n\r\n## Cause\r\n\r\n- Whole-model `2D Contour` sectioned the solid only once at `Top Z`.\r\n- Below `Top Z`, `contour_depth::ladder` stopped any ring blocked by a wider lower cross-section (a chamfered boss skirt, shoulder, or closed slot floor) and silently dropped deeper levels and tabs while returning `OpStatus::Ok`.\r\n\r\n## Tests\r\n\r\n- Pins in `crates/app/tests/contour_whole_step.rs` (`3 passed; 0 failed`):\r\n  - `case1_chamfered_island_top_contours_plate_to_bottom_with_tabs` (red before fix)\r\n  - `case2_plate_top_with_open_slot_contours_below_slot_floor_to_bottom_with_tabs` (red before fix)\r\n  - `whole_model_contour_that_cannot_reach_bottom_is_refused_with_the_stopped_level` (red before fix)\r\n- Pins in `crates/motion/tests/contour_whole.rs` (`8 passed; 0 failed` at 3dd8e3438):\r\n  - `middle_step_without_a_flat_level_gets_its_floor_pass` (review pin; red before 3dd8e3438: no lap at Z 10)\r\n  - `large_stepdown_keeps_the_upper_island_floor_pass_before_the_plate` (takeover pin; red before ceac40dd9)\r\n  - `counterbore_changing_before_first_cut_level_keeps_lower_bore` (asserts the upper bore lap at Z 10 since ceac40dd9; red before it)\r\n  - `earlier_blind_hole_stop_does_not_hide_later_counterbore_change`\r\n  - `two_islands_above_a_plate_continue_without_double_cutting_the_deeper_island`\r\n  - `counterbore_narrowing_below_top_z_walks_both_upper_and_lower_bores`\r\n  - `broken_lower_plane_refuses_rather_than_stopping_silently`\r\n  - `broken_vertical_sliver_between_levels_refuses_via_check_unread`\r\n- Mutation checks:\r\n  - Reverted `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs` to `upstream/main`: `contour_whole_step` went red (3 failed); restored: green (3 passed).\r\n  - Removed `check_unread` call in `contour_whole.rs`: `broken_vertical_sliver_between_levels_refuses_via_check_unread` went red (failed); restored: green (4 passed).\r\n  - Forced `hole_stop = None` in `contour_whole.rs::first_split`: `counterbore_narrowing_below_top_z_walks_both_upper_and_lower_bores` went red (failed); restored: green (4 passed).\r\n  - Passed untrimmed `&lad` instead of `&trimmed` to `emit_band` in `contour_whole.rs`: `two_islands_above_a_plate_continue_without_double_cutting_the_deeper_island` went red (double cut 194.130 mm vs ~97 mm); restored: green (4 passed).\r\n- Gate and lint:\r\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: green (`186 step(s), 0 failed`).\r\n  - `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main` at 3dd8e3438: green (`186 step(s), 0 failed`).\r\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: green (`0` warnings/errors).\r\n\r\n## Goldens moved\r\n\r\n- None (`0` `.nc` or `.cl` files changed against merge base).\r\n\r\n## Not exercised\r\n\r\n- Full `gate batch` and `gate release` tiers and UI snapshot tests (`camcraft-ui` was not modified).\r\n- Whole-model continuation for `Side::Inside` (delegates directly to single-band `contour_on_bodies`).\r\n\r\n## Overlaps\r\n\r\n- `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs`: touches a different function/arm than open PRs `#2420`, `#2253`, `#2149`, `#2035`, and `#1713` (whichever merges second refreshes).\r\n- `crates/motion/src/machining2d/mod.rs`: touches different lines than open PRs `#2450` and `#2149` (whichever merges second refreshes).\r\n\r\nChangelog: Whole-model 2D Contour now continues across lower stepped, chamfered, and slotted outlines down to Bottom Z with tabs, or refuses by name if a lower band cannot be sectioned.\r\n\r\nFixes #2436\r\n\r\n\r\n",
